title: WhaeaNyrie
---
<<wait 0.1>>
<<if $campfireStoryRead == true>>
    <<wait 0.1>>
    <<jump WhaeaNyrie_OutOfBounds>>
<<elseif $campfireStoryRead == false && $day == 1>>
    <<jump WhaeaNyrie_Day1>>
<<elseif $day == 2>>
    <<jump WhaeaNyrie_OutOfBounds>>
<<elseif $day == 3>>
    <<jump WhaeaNyrie_OutOfBounds>>
<<elseif $day == 4>>
    <<jump WhaeaNyrie_OutOfBounds>>
<<elseif $day == 5>>
    <<jump WhaeaNyrie_OutOfBounds>>
<<endif>>
===

title: WhaeaNyrie_Day1
---
Whaea Nyrie: Where do you think you're going?
Ernest: I'm just exploring. 
Whaea Nyrie: You are not allowed into the forest, remember?
Ernest: I know.. sorry.
Whaea Nyrie: If I catch you doing that again you'll be in serious trouble. 
<<if $talkedToNyrie == false>>
    <<set $talkedToNyrie = true>>
    <<set $peopleMet = $peopleMet + 1>>
<<endif>>
