title: WhaeaNyrie_OutOfBounds
---
Whaea Nyrie: Where do you think you're going?
Ernest: I'm just exploring. 
Whaea Nyrie: You are not allowed into the forest, remember?
Ernest: I know.. sorry.
Whaea Nyrie: If I catch you doing that again you'll be in serious trouble. 
<<set $caughtByTeacher = true>>
===

title: TeacherConfrontation
---
Whaea Nyrie: Good morning Ernest. Did you sleep well?
Ernest: Yes, I did.
Whaea Nyrie: You weren't woken up at all?
Ernest: No...
Whaea Nyrie: I heard some rustling in the grass. Almost like someone was up walking around.
    -> Ernest: It wasn't me.
        Ernest: It could've been the man from the campfire story.
        Whaea Nyrie: You know that was just a myth. You can't fool me.
        Ernest: I really didn't hear anything.
    -> Ernest: I didn't hear anything.
        Ernest: I was sleeping the entire night. I didn't hear anything.
Whaea Nyrie: It must've been my imagination. Alright, I'm keeping a close eye on you. If you go into that forest, just know I will catch you.
Whaea Nyrie: Mr Wilson is waiting for you, you better not keep him waiting.
===

